# Local environment files never go into an image: Vite would compile their VITE_* values
# (for example VITE_FIREBASE_EMULATORS=true from .env.local) into the production frontend.
# The web config comes from build arguments instead; see the Dockerfile.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

